  "description": "A build-time-only migration aid: converts AutoMapper Profiles into Mapwright mappers. An analyzer spots each class deriving from AutoMapper.Profile and offers a code fix that writes the equivalent [Mapper] partial class beside it, flagging every construct it cannot translate rather than dropping it. Install it for the migration, delete it afterwards. It takes no dependency on AutoMapper itself.",
